<section class="hpanel dim long" id="top" aria-labelledby="top-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-glow.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">Custom development</p><h1 class="rise" id="top-t">Software for the work your business needs to do.</h1><p class="fade">Websites, booking systems, online stores and business tools. Built for how your business works.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb fill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=custom-software{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=custom-software{% endif %}">Start a project<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><nav class="jump fade" aria-label="Services on this page"><a href="#web-applications">Websites</a><a href="#booking">Booking and loyalty</a><a href="#online-stores">Online stores</a><a href="#business-systems">Business tools</a></nav></div></section><section class="hpanel svc right" id="web-applications" aria-labelledby="web-applications-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-laptop-soft.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">01&nbsp;· Custom development</p><h2 class="rise" id="web-applications-t">Websites</h2><p class="fade">Fast, modern, and built to bring in calls and bookings on every phone.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=website{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=website{% endif %}">Start a project<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="hcap fade"><b>Tool Box LLC</b>&nbsp;· equipment rental website, designed and built by Velani</p></div><div class="hwin fade"><img style="--z:1.6;--x:4%;--y:0%" src="{{ 'night-tb-home.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Tool Box LLC website, built by Velani: equipment rental with job-site delivery and dates" width="2000" height="1250" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></section><section class="hpanel " id="booking" aria-labelledby="booking-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-phone-soft.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">02&nbsp;· Custom development</p><h2 class="rise" id="booking-t">Booking and loyalty</h2><p class="fade">Customers book from their phone. Reminders go out. The rewards card fills up.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=custom-software{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=custom-software{% endif %}">Start a project<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="hcap fade"><b>Yavi Barber</b>&nbsp;· booking and rewards app, designed and built by Velani</p></div><div class="hduo fade"><div class="ph"><img src="{{ 'night-yavi-book.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Yavi Barber booking on a phone: the next open times and services with prices" width="780" height="1688" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="ph"><img src="{{ 'night-yavi-rewards.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Yavi Barber rewards card on a phone: ten visits and two rewards" width="780" height="1688" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div></section><section class="hpanel svc right" id="online-stores" aria-labelledby="online-stores-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-store-soft.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">03&nbsp;· Custom development</p><h2 class="rise" id="online-stores-t">Online stores</h2><p class="fade">Products, delivery priced by distance, payment. Orders land where your team works.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=custom-software{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=custom-software{% endif %}">Start a project<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="hcap fade"><b>Tool Box LLC</b>&nbsp;· online equipment rental store, built by Velani</p></div><div class="hwin fade"><img style="--z:1.35;--x:10%;--y:11%" src="{{ 'night-store.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Tool Box LLC online store, built by Velani: rental equipment with prices and a Reserve button on each item" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></section><section class="hpanel svc" id="business-systems" aria-labelledby="business-systems-t"><img class="hph" src="{{ 'night-ai-room.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="hshade"></div><div class="hcopy"><p class="hkick">04&nbsp;· Custom development</p><h2 class="rise" id="business-systems-t">Business tools</h2><p class="fade">Requests, approvals and records in one place. A dashboard for your day.</p><div class="hacts fade"><a class="hb" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=custom-software{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=custom-software{% endif %}">Start a project<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="hcap fade"><b>NEVORA</b>&nbsp;· Velani’s own scheduling, time clock and payroll calculation app</p></div><div class="hwin fade"><img style="--z:1.6;--x:19%;--y:9%" src="{{ 'night-desk.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="NEVORA on the web, built by Velani: today’s shift, two items to review and a shift swap waiting for an answer" width="3600" height="2250" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></section><section class="how-page" aria-labelledby="how-t"><div class="wrap"><div class="how"><p class="hkick">How it works</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="how-t">How a custom project works</h2><ol class="rail" data-in><li data-in><i>01</i><b>We discuss the work</b><span>You show us how the work gets done today and who does it.</span></li><li data-in><i>02</i><b>You receive a written proposal</b><span>What we’ll build, what it costs, the milestones and who is responsible for what. Paid work starts only after you agree to it.</span></li><li data-in><i>03</i><b>We build in milestones</b><span>You review working software at each milestone.</span></li><li data-in><i>04</i><b>We hand it over</b><span>Who owns the code, what you receive and how support works after launch are all set in the written agreement.</span></li></ol></div></div></section><section class="hpanel end" id="velani" aria